    <div class="info-box">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> IdP-Initiated SSO Is a Larger Attack Surface</h4>
        <p>If IdP-initiated SSO is left enabled when the SP never needs it, the SP loses the ability to correlate a response to a request it made. This removes a useful check and gives an attacker more room to replay or redirect assertions.</p>
